# Ending the session closes its open episode, judged by its last run. The green run that ends the
# first red streak closes episode 1, so the next green run opens episode 2.
+0:00 run app red QuoteTest#oneNightStay
+1:00 run app green
+1:30 run app green
+2:00 run app red
+2:30 end
expect 1 green Fixing QuoteTest#oneNightStay
expect 2 red Working in app
